  "notes": "Announced in the post Au Large as Mistral's new flagship model, together with a new Mistral Small. Azure was Mistral's first distribution partner. The post also mentions self-deployment with access to the model weights for sensitive use cases, which is not a public weights release. The docs call it Mistral Large 1.0 (version 24.02). The slug ends in -1 because the family id is mistral.mistral-large. The docs page links https://legal.mistral.ai/ai-governance/models/mistral-large-1, which returns 404; the legal centre page is .../mistral-large-10/."
